Riley was curious about something. "Why did you use the fall I showed you?"

70
00:07:29.438 --> 00:07:34.833
Quinn shrugged. "Because your way of falling doesn't knock down living room lamps."

71
00:07:34.834 --> 00:07:38.834
Riley grinned. "Or break as many bones!"

72
00:07:38.835 --> 00:07:46.496
Soon the last rider in all the divisions crossed the finish line. Riley jumped to her feet.

73
00:07:46.497 --> 00:07:53.162
"Come on, Quinn!" she said eagerly. "Coach Adams is finally going to announce the new team!"

74
00:07:53.163 --> 00:08:01.090
Quinn held up crossed fingers. "I don’t have much hope, but maybe it'll be you and me in the junior division."

75
00:08:01.091 --> 00:08:09.188
"I think it will be!" Riley replied.

